Safe T1 armor shopping is in `games/nmmo/buyan/experiments/market/candidate.nim`. Baseline still never buys; this policy does only out of combat, no live enemy in Chebyshev 4, health ≥ 95, gold ≥ 9, a free inventory slot, and an empty helm/chest/legs slot with no matching inventory item. Flow is `ATN_BUY` (20) → tier-1 key (8) → item key 8..10. Existing sell/heal/fight/flee/equip/harvest stay above or after that. Failed gold/inventory confirm starts a 50-tick cooldown; reset clears shop state. Diagnostics (`attempt` / `acquired` / `failed` / `abort`) are separate from `strategy_action` issuance.

**Isolation:** `nim check -d:buyanTest candidate.nim` and `nim r -d:buyanTest tests.nim` both passed. Tests cover the full success path, failed confirm + cooldown, emergency abort, and the wire `strategy_action` marker (tick 10, action 20 vs baseline 25). No local scoring.

**Review vs baseline:** Only added shop UI continuation plus the 6b start-buy branch. Counterfactual is a cloned Mind with `decide(p, false)`. Unchanged abort moves are not counted.

